        "text": "<thinking> The task is to create a Python file named object_metadata.py that reads object metadata or head information from managed object storage using a concrete external provider. The chosen provider is Amazon S3, which is a widely used managed object storage service. The code will use the boto3 library, which is the Amazon Web Services (AWS) SDK for Python, to interact with S3. The boto3 library will be imported, and the S3 client will be instantiated to read the metadata of an object. </thinking>\n",
